      },
      {
        "text": "Judges have not ruled that trade secrets cannot be used to conceal information in cases like this.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "This lack of judicial action is why the introduction of the proposed bill is necessary.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
